# PHPStan baseline — tracks known errors that are acceptable.
# To regenerate: vendor/bin/phpstan analyse --configuration=phpstan.neon.dist --generate-baseline=phpstan-baseline.neon
#
# This file is intentionally empty because phpstan.neon.dist has
# blanket Eloquent/Facade ignore rules that suppress all common errors.
# If PHPStan reports new errors after upgrading, either:
#   1. Fix the code, or
#   2. Add the error pattern to phpstan.neon.dist ignoreErrors, or
#   3. Regenerate this baseline with the command above.
